===== en | 120x24 | statuses =====
statuses  the buffs and debuffs a skill or a trait puts on a unit

  dot          damages every turn
> poison       
  burn         
  stat_debuff  lowers a stat
  weaken       
  expose       
  blind        
  mire         
  bare         
  encumber     
  control      costs a turn
  stun         

  At the holder's turn, each stack costs 50% of the applier's stat.
  Over its 3 turns, one stack is 150%, and 450% at its cap.
  Damages every turn · 3 turns · up to 3 stacks.

  Declared figures: a trait amplifying or resisting changes what lands.
